# Age Calculator
# Calculate age from birth year

say "Age Calculator"

ask "What year is it now?"
set currentYear to answer

ask "What year were you born?"
set birthYear to answer

set age to currentYear - birthYear

say join "You are " and join age and " years old"

# Calculate in months and days (approximate)
set months to age * 12
set days to age * 365

say join "That's approximately " and join months and " months"
say join "Or about " and join days and " days"
